stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Uploaded : Document Uploaded by User

    Uploaded --> Validating : Check File Type & Magic Bytes
    Validating --> Rejected : Invalid Extension / Corrupt Signature
    Rejected --> [*] : Temporary File Deleted

    Validating --> Stored : Magic Bytes & MIME Validated
    Stored --> Ingesting_OCR : Extract Raw Text & Tables
    
    Ingesting_OCR --> Extracted : OCR Complete
    Extracted --> Analyzing_Financials : Calculate KPIs & Ratios
    
    Analyzing_Financials --> Anomaly_Scan : Evaluate Discrepancies
    Anomaly_Scan --> Processed : Analysis Persisted in DB

    state Processed {
        [*] --> Ready
        Ready --> Queryable : Available in AI Assistant
        Ready --> Reportable : Available in Financial Reports
    }

    Processed --> Deleting : User Confirms Deletion via Modal
    Deleting --> [*] : Atomic DB Rollback & Physical File Cleanup
